"in :gh:`75223`.)"

#: ../../deprecations/pending-removal-in-3.16.rst:78
msgid ":mod:`shutil`:"
msgstr ":mod:`shutil`:"

#: ../../deprecations/pending-removal-in-3.16.rst:80
