"See :pep:`PEP 688 <688#current-options>` for more details. (Contributed by "
"Shantanu Jain in :gh:`91896`.)"
msgstr ""
"Weitere Details findest du in :pep:`PEP 688 <688#current-options>`. "
"(Beigetragen von Shantanu Jain in :gh:`91896`.)"

